  I. TIMING COMPARISON AT n=6
  --------------------------------------------------

  n=6: H = 15
  Brute force:  0.16 ms  (checks 6! = 720 perms)
  Subset DP:    0.70 ms  (uses n^2 * 2^n = 2304 ops)
  Smart OCF:    0.20 ms
  All agree: False

